56345","lineage":["/proxy/provider/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345","/proxy/aggregator/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345"],"edmType":"IMAGE","year":{"def":["1883"]},"europeanaProxy":true,"pidList":{"def":["#pid_0"]}},{"about":"/proxy/aggregator/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345","dcDescription":{"en":["Men's jacket made of Chinese silk and lined with cotton. The jacket is decorated with stars and flowers in gold thread. \\Such gold wire fabrics are made in several parts of Sumatra. This is a jacket from Palembang. The silk was imported from mainland Southeast Asia (mostly from India).‖ In the past, material choices, colors, and ornamentation of fabrics were associated with the various walks of life. In modern Palembang, however, dress codes have come under pressure; only on ceremonial occasions are they still taken into account.‖ Exhibited at the Amsterdam World's Fair, 1883."]},"dcTitle":{"en":["Jacket"]},"edmIsRelatedTo":{"def":["http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/11079","http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/10354","http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/10419"]},"proxyIn":["/aggregation/aggregator/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345"],"proxyFor":"/item/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345","lineage":["/proxy/provider/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345"],"edmType":"IMAGE","europeanaProxy":false},{"about":"/proxy/provider/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345","dcDate":{"nl":["voor 1883"]},"dcDescription":{"nl":["Mannenjasje van Chinese zijde en gevoerd met katoen. Het jasje is versierd met sterren en bloemen in gouddraad. \nDergelijke gouddraadweefsels worden in meerdere delen van Sumatra gemaakt. Hier gaat het om een jasje uit Palembang. De zijde werd geïmporteerd vanuit het vasteland van Zuidoost-Azië (meestal vanuit India).\n\nVroeger waren materiaalkeuze, kleuren en versiering van de weefsels verbonden met de diverse standen in de samenleving. In het moderne Palembang zijn kledingvoorschriften echter onder druk komen te staan; slechts bij ceremoniële gelegenheden wordt er nog rekening mee gehouden.\n\nTentoongesteld tijdens de Wereldtentoonstelling Amsterdam, 1883."]},"dcIdentifier":{"def":["RV-370-2871"]},"dcTitle":{"nl":["Jasje"]},"dcType":{"def":["http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/10017","baju lelaki songkit pendek"],"en":["Object Type: main garments upper body"],"nl":["baadje"]},"dctermsCreated":{"nl":["1883-1883","1883"]},"dctermsIsPartOf":{"en":["Europeana XX: Century of Change"]},"dctermsMedium":{"def":["http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/10349","http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/10352"],"en":["Material: gold thread","Material: silk"]},"dctermsProvenance":{"nl":["1883-01-01","Aankoop"]},"proxyIn":["/aggregation/provider/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345"],"proxyFor":"/item/2048221/europeana_fashion_656345","edmType":"IMAGE","europeanaProxy":false}],"timespans":[{"about":"#1883","prefLabel":{"zxx":["1883"]},"begin":{"def":["1883-01-01"]},"end":{"def":["1883-12-31"]},"isPartOf":{"def":["http://data.europeana.eu/timespan/19"]},"skosNotation":{"def":["1883"]}},{"about":"http://data.europeana.eu/timespan/19","prefLabel":{"de":["19. Jahrhundert"],"ru":["XIX век"],"fi":["1800-luku"],"pt":["Século XIX"],"bg":["19 век"],"lt":["XIX amžius"],"lv":["19. gadsimts"],"hr":["19. stoljeće"],"fr":["XIXᵉ siècle"],"hu":["19. század"],"sk":["19. storočie"],"sl":["19. stoletje"],"ga":["19ú haois"],"ca":["Segle XIX"],"sv":["1800-talet"],"el":["19ος αιώνας"],"en":["19th century"],"it":["XIX secolo"],"es":["Siglo XIX"],"et":["19. sajand"],"eu":["XIX. mendea"],"cs":["19. století"],"pl":["XIX wiek"],"ro":["Secolul al XIX-lea"],"da":["19. århundrede"],"nl":["19e eeuw"]},"altLabel":{"ru":["19 век"],"sv":["19:e århundradet","19:e seklet","1800-tal","1800-talet (århundrade)","1800-talet (sekel)"],"en":["19th-century","Nineteenth century","19. century","XIX Century"],"it":["Ottocento","19° secolo","Secolo XIX","XIX Secolo","19esimo secolo","Diciannovesimo secolo","'800"],"pl":["19. wiek"],"fr":